use</span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>15th January 2025 </strong></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/09 : Amendment Approval; </u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover letter<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1387\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_17.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	2. Summary of the proposed amendment.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1388\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_18.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	3. Reason for the amendment.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1389\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_19.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	4. Impact of the amendment on the original study objectives.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1390\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_20.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	5. Impact of the amendment on the data generated<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1391\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_21.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	6. Impact of the amendment on safety and well-being.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1392\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_22.png</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	7. One Other Docs<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1393\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_17_00_20_23.png</a> dated 31st December 2024 Version 1</span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants amendment approval to the study </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>.</strong> <strong>(ECCT/25/01/09).</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-15', '2026-01-13', 'amd-1', 1, 0, NULL, '2025-01-15 09:48:38', '2025-01-15 09:50:02'),
