sp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 Dec 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Joel Investigator,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/11/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>P.O Box 381-3558,Accra,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/11/01 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Testronimal Study Phase 2</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Testronimal Study Phase 2</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1014\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1015\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_49_24.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1016\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1017\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_16_05_00.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1018\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_49_24_2.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1019\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_2.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1020\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_09_56_21.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	8. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1021\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_44_32.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	9. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1022\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_49_24_3.png</a> dated 19th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1023\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_3.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	11. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1024\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_4.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	12. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1025\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_5.png</a> dated 12th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1026\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_41_15.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1027\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41_2.png</a> dated 19th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	15. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1028\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41_3.png</a> dated 19th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	16. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1029\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_09_56_21_2.png</a> dated 13th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	17. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1030\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41_4.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	18. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1031\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_09_56_21_3.png</a> dated 13th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	19. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1032\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_49_24_4.png</a> dated 18th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	20. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1033\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_6.png</a> dated 12th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1034\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_28_39_7.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	22. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1035\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41_5.png</a> dated 19th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	23. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1036\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_16_05_00_2.png</a> dated 13th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	24. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1037\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_16_05_00_3.png</a> dated 18th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1038\">screenshot_from_2024_11_19_16_05_00_4.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	26. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1039\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_21_21.png</a> dated 19th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	27. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1040\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_32_41_6.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	28. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1041\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_09_21_21_2.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 5</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Trial category comments Eligendi natus liber</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Trial phase comments (if in disagreement with the study phase proposed):</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Reprehenderit tenet Assessor&rsquo;s discussion on the clinical development: Ipsam ut dolore expe Clinical Trial Rationale comments Earum ut obcaecati e Primary objectives comments In velit vel at fac Secondary objectives comments Quo quis aliquid mol Study population comments</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Quisquam dolor asper Inclusion criteria comments Ullam aspernatur sit Exclusion criteria comments Amet minima tempora Vulnerable populations comments Recusandae</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Quasi pe Study plan and design comments Quae nostrud sequi i Study treatment comments Tenetur ut doloribus Comparator IMP(s) comments Aute asperiores anim Placebo comments Vero blanditiis vel Auxilliary medicinal product(s) comments Architecto enim ad d Additional considerations comments Quia sapiente labori Safety comments Nam lorem velit aut Blinding and unblinding comments Similique qui est i Contraception measures comments Recusandae Pariatur Discontinuation criteria comments Beatae ipsam et even</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Other concomitant comments Commodi dicta mollit Safety and Monitoring comments Similique voluptatem Reference Safety Information comments Eveniet aut ut fugi Data Safety Monitoring Committee comments Animi quia dolor ev Definition of the end of the trial comments Aut cumque nostrum i Biological samples used in the study comments Qui quod ducimus om Data protection comments Velit qui consequat Recruitment and informed consent procedures comment Vel est perferendis Comments on the benefit/risk: Eius sit ut eveniet Overall comment/ conclusion on the clinical assessment:</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Aut assumenda occaec 1.5.1 REQUESTS FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION Ipsa maiores optio</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Testronimal Study Phase 2</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/11/01<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>21st November 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-05', '2025-12-05', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2024-12-05 16:22:31', '2024-12-05 16:22:54'),
(8, 121, 'ECCT/1/2024-ECCT/24/11/02', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/1/2024-ECCT/24/11/02&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 17 Dec 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Linus Sexton Ori Hill Jacob Mckay,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/11/02,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Aliquam fugiat qui officia veniam excepturi et nisi neque enim aliquip tempora,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/11/02 : Annual Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Iusto obcaecati Nam dicta veli</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1072\">screenshot_from_2024_11_28_11_17_15_2.png</a> dated 29th November 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	2. Annual progress report<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1100\">logo_28.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	3. SAE and SUSAR cumulative logs<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1101\">logo_29.png</a> dated 25th November 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	4. A signed checklist confirming the submission of the document<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1102\">logo_30.png</a> dated 19th December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	5. Evidence of registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1103\">logo_31.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	6. Copy of valid participants&rsquo; clinical trials insurance cover<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1104\">logo_32.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	7. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the study pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1105\">logo_33.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	8. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the investigators<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1106\">logo_34.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. Copy of the Annual Practice License for the Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1107\">logo_35.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	10. Copy of the Annual Practice License of the Investigators<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1108\">logo_36.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	11. Copy of current favourable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1109\">logo_37.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	12. The Development Safety Update Report (DSUR)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1110\">logo_38.png</a> dated 9th December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	13. Updated Investigators Brochure/Package inserts or Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1111\">logo_39.png</a> dated 25th November 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	14. Protocol Violations and Protocol Deviations logs<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1112\">logo_40.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	15. Latest Data Safety Monitoring Board (DSMB) report<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1113\">logo_41.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/11/02<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>17th December 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 07:14:38', '2024-12-17 07:15:03');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(9, 121, 'ECCT/2/2024-ECCT/24/11/02', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/2/2024-ECCT/24/11/02&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 17 Dec 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Linus Sexton Ori Hill Jacob Mckay,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/11/02,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Aliquam fugiat qui officia veniam excepturi et nisi neque enim aliquip tempora,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/11/02 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Iusto obcaecati Nam dicta veli</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1042\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47.png</a> dated 1st November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1043\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_2.png</a> dated 2nd November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1044\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_3.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1045\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_4.png</a> dated 3rd November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1046\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_5.png</a> dated 4th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1047\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_6.png</a> dated 5th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1048\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_7.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1049\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_8.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1050\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_9.png</a> dated 9th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1051\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_10.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1052\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_11.png</a> dated 9th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1053\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_12.png</a> dated 20th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1054\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_13.png</a> dated 14th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1055\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_14.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1056\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_15.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1057\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_16.png</a> dated 7th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1058\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_17.png</a> dated 13th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1059\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_18.png</a> dated 6th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1060\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_19.png</a> dated 14th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1061\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_20.png</a> dated 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1062\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_21.png</a> dated 5th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1063\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_22.png</a> dated 5th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1064\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_23.png</a> dated 12th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1065\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_24.png</a> dated 6th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1066\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_25.png</a> dated 4th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1067\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_26.png</a> dated 12th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1068\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_27.png</a> dated 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1069\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_28.png</a> dated 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1070\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_29.png</a> dated 11th November 2024 Version 4</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/11/02<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>29th November 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 07:15:18', '2024-12-17 07:15:44'),
(10, 125, 'ECCT/1/1970-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '', NULL, NULL, '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 09:39:00', '2024-12-17 09:39:00'),
(11, 125, 'ECCT/7/2024-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/12/01/2024(11)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 17th December 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Lawrence Jennings Aladdin Powers Elton Delgado,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/12/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ut facere ea aliquam eveniet,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/12/01 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>sample</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Et eius sit aut et fugiat adi</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1071\">screenshot_from_2024_11_28_11_17_15.png</a> dated 28th November 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	2. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1118\">logo_46.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	3. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1130\">logo_58.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	15. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1131\">logo_59.png</a> dated 4th December 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1132\">logo_60.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1133\">logo_61.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1134\">logo_62.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1135\">logo_63.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1136\">logo_64.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1137\">logo_65.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	22. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1138\">logo_66.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1139\">logo_67.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1140\">logo_68.png</a> dated 12th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	25. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1141\">logo_69.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	26. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1142\">logo_70.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	27. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1143\">logo_71.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 9<br />\r\n	28. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1144\">logo_72.png</a> dated 13th December 2024 Version 2</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:reviewer_summary_comments</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	sample</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/12/01<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>17th December 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 09:52:14', '2025-01-06 10:28:11');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(12, 125, 'ECCT/3/2024-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/3/2024-ECCT/24/12/01&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 17 Dec 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Lawrence Jennings Aladdin Powers Elton Delgado,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/12/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ut facere ea aliquam eveniet,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/12/01 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>sample</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Et eius sit aut et fugiat adi</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1071\">screenshot_from_2024_11_28_11_17_15.png</a> dated 28th November 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	2. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1118\">logo_46.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	3. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1130\">logo_58.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	15. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1131\">logo_59.png</a> dated 4th December 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1132\">logo_60.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1133\">logo_61.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1134\">logo_62.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1135\">logo_63.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1136\">logo_64.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1137\">logo_65.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	22. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1138\">logo_66.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1139\">logo_67.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1140\">logo_68.png</a> dated 12th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	25. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1141\">logo_69.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	26. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1142\">logo_70.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	27. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1143\">logo_71.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 9<br />\r\n	28. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1144\">logo_72.png</a> dated 13th December 2024 Version 2</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	sample</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/12/01<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>17th December 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 09:52:27', '2024-12-17 09:53:09'),
(13, 13, 'ECCT/24/03/01/2024(13)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/03/01/2024(13)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 17th December 2024</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal Investigator  Investigator,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/03/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>67-Chuka,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/03/01 : Initial Approval; <p>\r\n	Javan&#39;s Study for a test clinical Trial</p>\r\n&nbsp; Javan\'s Study for a test clini</u></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/475\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>2. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/476\">amendmentletter_5</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>3. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/477\">amendmentletter_3</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>4. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/478\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>5. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/479\">amendmentletter_3</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>6. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/480\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>7. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/481\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>8. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/482\">amendmentletter_3</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>9. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/483\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_21_26.png</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>10. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/484\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_41_31.png</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>11. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/485\">screenshot_from_2024_03_11_14_38_21.png</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.0<br>12. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/486\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_21_26_2.png</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 1.4<br>13. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/487\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_21_26_3.png</a> dated 13th March 2024 Version 2.0<br>14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/488\">arms_7_2.png</a> dated 14th March 2024 Version 2.1<br>15. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/489\">cipit_course_intro.pptx</a> dated 13th March 2024 Version 2.0<br>16. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/490\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_21_26_4.png</a> dated 11th March 2024 Version 4.0<br>17. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/491\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_21_26_5.png</a> dated 12th March 2024 Version 4.0<br>18. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/492\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_41_31_2.png</a> dated 6th March 2024 Version 6<br>19. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/493\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 12th March 2024 Version 5<br>20. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/494\">amendmentletter_9</a> dated 13th March 2024 Version 2.0<br>21. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/495\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_37_51.png</a> dated 13th March 2024 Version 7<br>22. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/496\">amendmentletter_5</a> dated 4th March 2024 Version 4<br>23. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/497\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_37_51_2.png</a> dated 5th March 2024 Version 4<br>24. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/498\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_41_31_3.png</a> dated 13th March 2024 Version 2<br>25. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/499\">screenshot_from_2024_03_14_12_37_51_3.png</a> dated 6th March 2024 Version 4<br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:reviewer_summary_comments</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Javan&#39;s Study for a test clinical Trial</p>\r\n ECCT/24/03/01<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>17th December 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2024-12-17', '2025-12-17', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2024-12-17 09:56:12', '2024-12-17 09:56:12'),
(14, 11, 'ECCT/1/2024-ECCT/24/02/01', 0, '<p>\r\n	test</p>\r\n', NULL, NULL, '2025-01-06', '2026-01-31', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-06 10:16:45', '2025-01-06 10:16:45');
