Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/752\">men_s_mental_health_awareness_8.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 1.0<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/753\">men_s_mental_health_awareness_9.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2.1<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/754\">1718068595_ppb.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 1.5<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/755\">1718068595_ppb_2.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2.0<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/756\">1718068595_ppb_3.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 1.0<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/757\">1718068595_ppb_4.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2.1<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/758\">1718068595_ppb_5.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2.5<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/759\">1718068595_ppb_6.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 3.4<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/760\">1718068595_ppb_7.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2.7<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/761\">1718068595_ppb_8.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 5.0<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/762\">1718068595_ppb_9.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 4.0<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/763\">1718026860_ppb_4.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 3.4<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/764\">1718026800_ppb_8.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 5.6<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/765\">1718026794_ppb_5.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 1.5<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/766\">1717987549_ppb_8.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 3.4<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/767\">psur_22_3.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 6.8<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/768\">psur_22_4.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 4.4<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/769\">1717987549_ppb_9.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 6.2<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/770\">psur_22_5.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 3.3<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/771\">1718068595_ppb_10.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 3.4<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/772\">1718068595_ppb_11.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/773\">men_s_mental_health_awareness_10.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/774\">receipt_2_2.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/775\">receipt_2_3.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 7<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/776\">receipt_2_4.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/777\">receipt_2_5.pdf</a>&nbsp;dated 18th June 2024 Version 2</span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Comprehensive Analysis of Genetic Markers to Predict Efficacy and Personalize Treatment Strategies in Cancer Patients: A Multi-Center Prospective Cohort Study</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/06/03<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is&nbsp;<b>19th June 2025</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		Yours Sincerely,</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\">:signature</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\">:approver</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, NULL, '2025-01-05', '2025-01-07', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-06 10:46:03', '2025-01-06 10:57:33'),
(22, 125, 'ECCT/7/2024-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/7/2024-ECCT/24/12/01&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Lawrence Jennings Aladdin Powers Elton Delgado,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/12/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ut facere ea aliquam eveniet,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/12/01 : Annual Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>sample</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Et eius sit aut et fugiat adi</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1185\">logo_is_b.jpg</a> dated 9th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	2. Annual progress report<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1186\">logo_is_b_2.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	3. SAE and SUSAR cumulative logs<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1187\">logo_is_b_3.jpg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version 5<br />\r\n	4. Latest Data Safety Monitoring Board (DSMB) report<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1188\">logo_is_b_4.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version 6<br />\r\n	5. Protocol Violations and Protocol Deviations logs<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1189\">logo_is_b_5.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	6. Updated Investigators Brochure/Package inserts or Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1190\">logo_is_b_6.jpg</a> dated 30th December 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	7. The Development Safety Update Report (DSUR)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1191\">logo_is_b_7.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	8. Copy of current favourable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1192\">logo_is_b_8.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	9. Copy of the Annual Practice License of the Investigators<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1193\">logo_is_b_9.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	10. Copy of the Annual Practice License for the Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1194\">logo_is_b_10.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	11. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the investigators<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1195\">logo_is_b_11.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	12. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the study pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1196\">logo_is_b_12.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	13. Copy of valid participants&rsquo; clinical trials insurance cover<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1197\">logo_is_b_13.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1198\">logo_is_b_14.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version<br />\r\n	15. A signed checklist confirming the submission of the document<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1199\">logo_is_b_15.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.1 Introduction Maiores porro natus Primary pharmacodynamics comments Voluptatibus non cup Secondary pharmacodynamics comments Tenetur cillum ut nu Pharmacodynamic drug interactions comments Magni perferendis iu Pharmacokinetics comments Dolorum amet assume Absorption, Distribution, Metabolism &amp; Excretion comments Qui eaque occaecat m Other pharmacokinetic studies comments Quaerat laboris dign Animal species selection/Study design comments Minim amet ea offic Single dose toxicity comments Voluptatem deleniti Repeat-dose toxicity comments Magnam omnis est des Genotoxicity comments Possimus sint tempo Carcinogenicity comments Repellendus Dolor i Reproductive and developmental toxicity - comments Officia dolore sit Juvenile toxicity studies comments Et aliqua Do eum qu Other studies (including enhanced PPND studies) comments Aut natus quibusdam Local tolerance comments Atque nostrum laboru Other toxicity studies comments Nostrud itaque volup Additional Considerations comments Quam eius rerum quia GLP aspects comments Voluptatibus in ex f Overall comment/ conclusion on the non-clinical assessment Eius sint ut debitis </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	sample</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/12/01<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-07', '2026-01-07', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-01-07 08:40:13', '2025-01-07 08:41:23');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(23, 127, 'ECCT/25/01/01/2025(10)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/01/2025(10)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7th January 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Aidan Madden Yeo Christensen Nola Nielsen,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Consectetur iure ea blanditiis illo facilis sed magna elit non alias,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/01 : Initial Approval; <p>\r\n	Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</p>\r\n&nbsp; Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</u></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1158\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_06_08_56_08.xls</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>2. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1159\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>3. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1160\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1161\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1162\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 1<br>6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1163\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1164\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2.1<br>8. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1165\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>9. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1166\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2<br>10. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1167\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>11. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1168\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>12. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1169\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>13. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1170\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>14. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1171\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1172\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>16. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1173\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>17. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1174\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1175\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>19. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1176\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>20. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1177\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1178\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 3<br>22. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1179\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>23. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1180\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>24. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1181\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>25. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1182\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>26. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1183\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>27. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1184\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:reviewer_summary_comments</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/01<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-07', '2026-01-07', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-01-07 08:50:52', '2025-01-07 08:50:52'),
(24, 125, 'ECCT/8/2024-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/8/2024-ECCT/24/12/01&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n