/1187\">logo_is_b_3.jpg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version 5<br>4. Latest Data Safety Monitoring Board (DSMB) report<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1188\">logo_is_b_4.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version 6<br>5. Protocol Violations and Protocol Deviations logs<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1189\">logo_is_b_5.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>6. Updated Investigators Brochure/Package inserts or Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1190\">logo_is_b_6.jpg</a> dated 30th December 2024 Version 6<br>7. The Development Safety Update Report (DSUR)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1191\">logo_is_b_7.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>8. Copy of current favourable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1192\">logo_is_b_8.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>9. Copy of the Annual Practice License of the Investigators<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1193\">logo_is_b_9.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>10. Copy of the Annual Practice License for the Pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1194\">logo_is_b_10.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>11. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the investigators<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1195\">logo_is_b_11.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>12. Copy of the valid professional indemnity insurance cover for the study pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1196\">logo_is_b_12.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>13. Copy of valid participantsâ€™ clinical trials insurance cover<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1197\">logo_is_b_13.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>14. Evidence of registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry  https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1198\">logo_is_b_14.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>15. A signed checklist confirming the submission of 