24 Version 1<br>3. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br>5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br>6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>9. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1130\">logo_58.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>15. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1131\">logo_59.png</a> dated 4th December 2024 Version 6<br>16. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1132\">logo_60.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1133\">logo_61.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 5<br>18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1134\">logo_62.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>19. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1135\">logo_63.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 5<br>20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1136\">logo_64.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br>21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1137\">logo_65.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>22. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1138\">logo_66.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 1<br>23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1139\">logo_67.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1140\">logo_68.png</a> dated 12th December 2024 Version 5<br>25. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/11