24 Version 1<br>3. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br>5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br>6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>9. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1130\">logo_58.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>15. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1131\">logo_59.png</a> dated 4th December 2024 Version 6<br>16. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1132\">logo_60.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1133\">logo_61.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 5<br>18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1134\">logo_62.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>19. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1135\">logo_63.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 5<br>20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1136\">logo_64.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br>21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1137\">logo_65.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>22. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1138\">logo_66.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 1<br>23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1139\">logo_67.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1140\">logo_68.png</a> dated 12th December 2024 Version 5<br>25. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1141\">logo_69.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br>26. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1142\">logo_70.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>27. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1143\">logo_71.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 9<br>28. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1144\">logo_72.png</a> dated 13th December 2024 Version 2<br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.1 Introduction\nMaiores porro natus \n\nPrimary pharmacodynamics comments\nVoluptatibus non cup\n\nSecondary pharmacodynamics comments\nTenetur cillum ut nu\n\nPharmacodynamic drug interactions comments\nMagni perferendis iu\n\nPharmacokinetics comments\nDolorum amet assume\n\nAbsorption, Distribution, Metabolism & Excretion comments\nQui eaque occaecat m\n\n Other pharmacokinetic studies comments\nQuaerat laboris dign\n\nAnimal species selection/Study design comments\nMinim amet ea offic\n\nSingle dose toxicity comments\nVoluptatem deleniti \n\nRepeat-dose toxicity comments\nMagnam omnis est des\n\nGenotoxicity comments\nPossimus sint tempo\n\nCarcinogenicity comments\nRepellendus Dolor i\n\nReproductive and developmental toxicity - comments\nOfficia dolore sit \n\nJuvenile toxicity studies comments\nEt aliqua Do eum qu\n\nOther studies (including enhanced PPND studies) comments\nAut natus quibusdam \n\nLocal tolerance comments\nAtque nostrum laboru\n\nOther toxicity studies comments\nNostrud itaque volup\n\nAdditional Considerations comments\nQuam eius rerum quia\n\nGLP aspects comments\nVoluptatibus in ex f\n\nOverall comment/ conclusion on the non-c