24 Version 1<br>3. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br>5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br>6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br>9. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br>14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1130\