41\">logo_69.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br>26. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1142\">logo_70.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br>27. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1143\">logo_71.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 9<br>28. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1144\">logo_72.png</a> dated 13th December 2024 Version 2<br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.1 Introduction\nMaiores porro natus \n\nPrimary pharmacodynamics comments\nVoluptatibus non cup\n\nSecondary pharmacodynamics comments\nTenetur cillum ut nu\n\nPharmacodynamic drug interactions comments\nMagni perferendis iu\n\nPharmacokinetics comments\nDolorum amet assume\n\nAbsorption, Distribution, Metabolism & Excretion comments\nQui eaque occaecat m\n\n Other pharmacokinetic studies comments\nQuaerat laboris dign\n\nAnimal species selection/Study design comments\nMinim amet ea offic\n\nSingle dose toxicity comments\nVoluptatem deleniti \n\nRepeat-dose toxicity comments\nMagnam omnis est des\n\nGenotoxicity comments\nPossimus sint tempo\n\nCarcinogenicity comments\nRepellendus Dolor i\n\nReproductive and developmental toxicity - comments\nOfficia dolore sit \n\nJuvenile toxicity studies comments\nEt aliqua Do eum qu\n\nOther studies (including enhanced PPND studies) comments\nAut natus quibusdam \n\nLocal tolerance comments\nAtque nostrum laboru\n\nOther toxicity studies comments\nNostrud itaque volup\n\nAdditional Considerations comments\nQuam eius rerum quia\n\nGLP aspects comments\nVoluptatibus in ex f\n\nOverall comment/ conclusion on the non-c