(35, 125, 'ECCT/19/2024-ECCT/24/12/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/19/2024-ECCT/24/12/01&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Lawrence Jennings Aladdin Powers Elton Delgado,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/12/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ut facere ea aliquam eveniet,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/12/01 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>sample</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Et eius sit aut et fugiat adi</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1071\">screenshot_from_2024_11_28_11_17_15.png</a> dated 28th November 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	2. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1118\">logo_46.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	3. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1119\">logo_47.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1120\">logo_48.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1121\">logo_49.png</a> dated 1st December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1122\">logo_50.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1123\">logo_51.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	8. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1124\">logo_52.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1125\">logo_53.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1126\">logo_54.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1127\">logo_55.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1128\">logo_56.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1129\">logo_57.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1130\">logo_58.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	15. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1131\">logo_59.png</a> dated 4th December 2024 Version 6<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1132\">logo_60.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1133\">logo_61.png</a> dated 10th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1134\">logo_62.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1135\">logo_63.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1136\">logo_64.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1137\">logo_65.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	22. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1138\">logo_66.png</a> dated 3rd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1139\">logo_67.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1140\">logo_68.png</a> dated 12th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	25. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1141\">logo_69.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 1<br />\r\n	26. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1142\">logo_70.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 2<br />\r\n	27. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1143\">logo_71.png</a> dated 2nd December 2024 Version 9<br />\r\n	28. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1144\">logo_72.png</a> dated 13th December 2024 Version 2</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.1 Introduction Maiores porro natus Primary pharmacodynamics comments Voluptatibus non cup Secondary pharmacodynamics comments Tenetur cillum ut nu Pharmacodynamic drug interactions comments Magni perferendis iu Pharmacokinetics comments Dolorum amet assume Absorption, Distribution, Metabolism &amp; Excretion comments Qui eaque occaecat m Other pharmacokinetic studies comments Quaerat laboris dign Animal species selection/Study design comments Minim amet ea offic Single dose toxicity comments Voluptatem deleniti Repeat-dose toxicity comments Magnam omnis est des Genotoxicity comments Possimus sint tempo Carcinogenicity comments Repellendus Dolor i Reproductive and developmental toxicity - comme