bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7th January 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Baker Spears Cassandra Castaneda Lane Robbins,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/02,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Officiis illo laborum cupiditate do dolores omnis in sint quisquam nostrud fuga Perspiciatis nemo,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/02 : Initial Approval; <p>\r\n	Jan 7th</p>\r\n&nbsp; Quis quaerat anim voluptatem p</u></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1201\">logo_is_b_16.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>2. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1202\">logo_is_b_17.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>3. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1203\">logo_is_b_18.jpg</a> dated 3rd January 2025 Version <br>4. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1204\">logo_is_b_19.jpg</a> dated 4th January 2025 Version <br>5. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1205\">logo_is_b_20.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>6. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1206\">logo_is_b_21.jpg</a> dated 4th January 2025 Version <br>7. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1207\">logo_is_b_22.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>8. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1208\">logo_is_b_23.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>9. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1209\">logo_is_b_24.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>10. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1210\">logo_is_b_25.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>11. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1211\">logo_is_b_26.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>12. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1212\">logo_is_b_27.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>13. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1213\">logo_is_b_28.jpg</a> dated 3rd January 2025 Version <br>14. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1214\">logo_is_b_29.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>15. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1215\">logo_is_b_30.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>16. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1216\">logo_is_b_31.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>17. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1217\">logo_is_b_32.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>18. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1218\">logo_is_b_33.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>19. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1219\">logo_is_b_34.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>20. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1220\">logo_is_b_35.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>21. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1221\">logo_is_b_36.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>22. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1222\">logo_is_b_37.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>23. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1223\">logo_is_b_38.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>24. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1224\">logo_is_b_39.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>25. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1225\">logo_is_b_40.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>26. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1226\">logo_is_b_41.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>27. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1227\">logo_is_b_42.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>28. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1228\">logo_is_b_43.jpg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;:reviewer_summary_comments</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Jan 7th</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/02<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-07', '2026-01-07', 'submitted', 1, '2025-01-07 13:14:37', '2025-01-07 09:41:02', '2025-01-07 13:14:37');
