"/attachments/download/1202\">logo_is_b_17.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>3. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1203\">logo_is_b_18.jpg</a> dated 3rd January 2025 Version <br>4. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1204\">logo_is_b_19.jpg</a> dated 4th January 2025 Version <br>5. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1205\">logo_is_b_20.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>6. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1206\">logo_is_b_21.jpg</a> dated 4th January 2025 Version <br>7. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1207\">logo_is_b_22.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>8. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1208\">logo_is_b_23.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>9. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1209\">logo_is_b_24.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>10. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1210\">logo_is_b_25.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>11. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1211\">logo_is_b_26.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>12. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1212\">logo_is_b_27.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>13. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1213\">logo_is_b_28.jpg</a> dated 3rd January 2025 Version <br>14. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1214\">logo_is_b_29.jpg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>15. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1215\">logo_is_b_30.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>16. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1216\">logo_is_b_31.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>17. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1217\">logo_is_b_32.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>18. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1218\">logo_is_b_33.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>19. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1219\">logo_is_b_34.jpg</a> dated 1st January 2025 Version <br>20. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1220\">logo_is_b_35.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>21. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1221\">logo_is_b_36.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>22. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1222\">logo_is_b_37.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>23. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1223\">logo_is_b_38.jpg</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>24. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1224\">logo_is_b_39.jpg</a> dated 5th January 2025 Version <br>25. Indemnity cover for PI,  inve