><br />\r\n	Voluptates dolor aut<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Overall comment/ conclusion on the non-clinical assessment</strong><br />\r\n	Quis non optio eos<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Jan 7th</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/02<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-07', '2026-01-07', 'submitted', 1, '2025-01-07 13:15:51', '2025-01-07 10:13:53', '2025-01-07 13:15:51'),
(40, 127, 'ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/01', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/01&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Aidan Madden Yeo Christensen Nola Nielsen,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Consectetur iure ea blanditiis illo facilis sed magna elit non alias,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/01 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1158\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_06_08_56_08.xls</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	2. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1159\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	3. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1160\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	4. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1161\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	5. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1162\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 1<br />\r\n	6. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1163\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	7. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1164\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2.1<br />\r\n	8. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1165\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	9. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1166\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2<br />\r\n	10. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1167\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	11. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1168\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	12. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1169\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	13. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1170\">approvalletter_14</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	14. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1171\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1172\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1173\">approvalletter_14</a> dated Version<br />\r\n	17. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1174\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1175\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	19. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1176\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	20. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1177\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1178\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 3<br />\r\n	22. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1179\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	23. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1180\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	24. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1181\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	25. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1182\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	26. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1183\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version<br />\r\n	27. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1184\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/01/01<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-01-07', '2026-01-07', 'approved', 1, '2025-01-08 15:30:40', '2025-01-07 10:19:19', '2025-01-08 15:30:40');
