y 2025 Version <br>3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1161\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1162\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 1<br>5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1163\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1164\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2.1<br>7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1167\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>8. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1168\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1165\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1169\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1170\">approvalletter_14</a> dated  Version <br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1171\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>13. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1166\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 2<br>14. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1172\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>15. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1173\">approvalletter_14</a> dated  Version <br>16. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1159\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 6th January 2025 Version <br>17. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1175\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>18. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1174\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>19. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1176\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>20. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1177\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>21. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1178\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version 3<br>22. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1179\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>23. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1180\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>24. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1181\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>25. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1182\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>26. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1183\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br>27. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1184\">approvalletter_14</a> dated 7th January 2025 Version <br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Laborum Doloribus illo impedi</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/01<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-01-08', '2026-01-08', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-01-08 15:31:02', '2025-01-08 15:31:02'),
