ent workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1315\">images_19.jpeg</a> dated 10th January 2025 Version <br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1319\">images_23.jpeg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1320\">images_24.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1323\">images_27.jpeg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>16. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1322\">images_26.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1321\">images_25.jpeg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1318\">images_22.jpeg</a> dated 16th January 2025 Version <br>19. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1317\">images_21.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1316\">images_20.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1311\">images_15.jpeg</a> dated 10th January 2025 Version <br>22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1310\">images_14.jpeg</a> dated 9th January 2025 Version <br>23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1309\">images_13.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1308\">images_12.jpeg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1307\">images_11.jpeg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>26. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1306\">images_10.jpeg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1305\">images_9.jpeg</a> dated 1st January 1970 Version <br>28. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1304\">images_8.jpeg</a> dated 13th January 2025 Version <br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <p>\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	At asperiores volupt<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Fugiat aut do proide<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Illo esse dolor ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus magni<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Et ea adipisci dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	In fugit excepturi<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Minima in magna ut v<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus delec<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Consectetur consect<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Est blanditiis praes<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Maxime cupidatat vel<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ratione nihil praese<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Pariatur Consectetu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Qui eu tenetur dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Ipsum dicta delectu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Odio sint non offici<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Dolore blanditiis qu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	Excepturi mollitia e<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Sapiente nemo maxime<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Mollit qui numquam d<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Blanditiis omnis lab<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Porro ex sed consequ<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Voluptatem Sit blan<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ut quia voluptatum a<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/09<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>13th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-13', '2026-01-13', 'submitted', 1, '2025-01-13 14:59:40', '2025-01-13 14:52:32', '2025-01-13 14:59:40');
