proval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1309\">images_13.jpeg</a> dated 8th January 2025 Version <br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1308\">images_12.jpeg</a> dated  Version <br>25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1307\">images_11.jpeg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>26. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1306\">images_10.jpeg</a> dated 2nd January 2025 Version <br>27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1305\">images_9.jpeg</a> dated  Version <br>28. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1304\">images_8.jpeg</a> dated 13th January 2025 Version <br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <p>\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	At asperiores volupt<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Fugiat aut do proide<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Illo esse dolor ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus magni<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance us