the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1315\">images_19.jpeg</a> dated: 10th January 2025<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1319\">images_23.jpeg</a><br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1320\">images_24.jpeg</a> dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1323\">images_27.jpeg</a><br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1322\">images_26.jpeg</a> dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1321\">images_25.jpeg</a> dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1318\">images_22.jpeg</a> dated: 16th January 2025<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1317\">images_21.jpeg</a> dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1316\">images_20.jpeg</a> dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1311\">images_15.jpeg</a> dated: 10th January 2025<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1310\">images_14.jpeg</a> dated: 9th January 2025<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1309\">images_13.jpeg</a> dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1308\">images_12.jpeg</a><br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1307\">images_11.jpeg</a> dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1306\">images_10.jpeg</a> dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1305\">images_9.jpeg</a><br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1304\">images_8.jpeg</a> dated: 13th January 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	At asperiores volupt<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Fugiat aut do proide<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Illo esse dolor ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus magni<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Et ea adipisci dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	In fugit excepturi<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Minima in magna ut v<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus delec<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Consectetur consect<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Est blanditiis praes<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Maxime cupidatat vel<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ratione nihil praese<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Pariatur Consectetu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Qui eu tenetur dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Ipsum dicta delectu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Odio sint non offici<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Dolore blanditiis qu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	Excepturi mollitia e<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Sapiente nemo maxime<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Mollit qui numquam d<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Blanditiis omnis lab<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Porro ex sed consequ<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Voluptatem Sit blan<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ut quia voluptatum a<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/01/09<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>13th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-13', '2026-01-13', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-13 15:13:27', '2025-01-14 09:19:56'),
(60, 2, 'ECCT/24/01/01/2025(32)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/01/01/2025(32)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 13th January 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/01/01,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>some address,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/01/01 : Initial Approval; <p>\r\n	Sample Title</p>\r\n&nbsp; Short Title</u></strong></span><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/558\">icon_adr.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>2. The Study Protocol<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/559\">icon_adr_2.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/560\">icon_adr_3.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/561\">icon_adr_4.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/562\">icon_adr_5.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/563\">icon_adr_6.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/564\">icon_adr_7.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>8. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/565\">icon_adr_8.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/566\">icon_adr_9.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/567\">icon_adr_10.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/568\">icon_adr_11.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/569\">icon_adr_12.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/570\">icon_adr_13.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/571\">icon_adr_14.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/572\">icon_adr_15.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>16. Detailed budget of the study<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/573\">icon_adr_16.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/574\">icon_adr_17.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/575\">icon_adr_18.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>19. Indemnity cover for PI,  investigators and study Pharmacist. <br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/576\">icon_adr_19.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/577\">icon_adr_20.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/578\">icon_adr_21.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/579\">icon_adr_22.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br>23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/580\">icon_adr_23.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/581\">icon_adr_24.png</a> dated: 22nd May 2024  Version 1<br>25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/582\">icon_adr_25.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br>26. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/583\">icon_adr_26.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br>27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/584\">icon_adr_27.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br>28. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/585\">icon_adr_28.png</a> dated: 15th May 2024  Version 1<br></span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Sample Title</p>\r\n ECCT/24/01/01<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>13th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-13', '2026-01-13', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-01-13 15:28:34', '2025-01-13 15:28:34');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(61, 118, 'ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/09', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/09&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 14 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Hiroko Lewis Tatyana Medina Castor Gallagher,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/09,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Nisi qui dolor optio tempore quisquam laborum Suscipit,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/09 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Virunex-3 Trial for Novacov-24</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1296\">screenshot_from_2025_01_13_09_17_34.png</a> dated dated: 3rd January 2025<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1297\">images.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1298\">images_2.jpeg</a> dated dated: 3rd January 2025<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1299\">images_3.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1300\">images_4.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1301\">images_5.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1302\">images_6.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1303\">images_7.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1312\">images_16.jpeg</a> dated dated: 10th January 2025<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1314\">images_18.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1313\">images_17.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1315\">images_19.jpeg</a> dated dated: 10th January 2025<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1319\">images_23.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1320\">images_24.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1323\">images_27.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1322\">images_26.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1321\">images_25.jpeg</a> dated dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1318\">images_22.jpeg</a> dated dated: 16th January 2025<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1317\">images_21.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1316\">images_20.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1311\">images_15.jpeg</a> dated dated: 10th January 2025<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1310\">images_14.jpeg</a> dated dated: 9th January 2025<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1309\">images_13.jpeg</a> dated dated: 8th January 2025<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1308\">images_12.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1307\">images_11.jpeg</a> dated dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1306\">images_10.jpeg</a> dated dated: 2nd January 2025<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1305\">images_9.jpeg</a> dated<br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1304\">images_8.jpeg</a> dated dated: 13th January 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	At asperiores volupt<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Fugiat aut do proide<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Illo esse dolor ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus magni<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Et ea adipisci dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	In fugit excepturi<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Minima in magna ut v<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus delec<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Consectetur consect<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Est blanditiis praes<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Maxime cupidatat vel<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ratione nihil praese<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Pariatur Consectetu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Qui eu tenetur dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Ipsum dicta delectu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Odio sint non offici<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Dolore blanditiis qu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	Excepturi mollitia e<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Sapiente nemo maxime<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Mollit qui numquam d<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Blanditiis omnis lab<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Porro ex sed consequ<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Voluptatem Sit blan<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ut quia voluptatum a<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/01/09<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>13th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-01-14', '2026-01-14', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-14 09:20:28', '2025-01-14 09:22:25'),
