bsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 14 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Hiroko Lewis Tatyana Medina Castor Gallagher,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/09,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Nisi qui dolor optio tempore quisquam laborum Suscipit,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/09 : Annual Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Virunex-3 Trial for Novacov-24</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1324\">sae_27</a> dated: 30th December 2024 Version 5<br />\r\n	2. Annual progress report<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1325\">sae_27</a> dated: 6th January 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	At asperiores volupt<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Fugiat aut do proide<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Illo esse dolor ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus magni<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Et ea adipisci dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	In fugit excepturi<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Minima in magna ut v<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Necessitatibus delec<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Consectetur consect<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Est blanditiis praes<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Maxime cupidatat vel<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ratione nihil praese<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Pariatur Consectetu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br />\r\n	Qui eu tenetur dolor<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Ipsum dicta delectu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br />\r\n	Odio sint non offici<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Dolore blanditiis qu<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br />\r\n	Excepturi mollitia e<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Sapiente nemo maxime<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Mollit qui numquam d<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Blanditiis omnis lab<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br />\r\n	Porro ex sed consequ<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Voluptatem Sit blan<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ut quia voluptatum a<br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Clinical Trial to Evaluate the Efficacy and Safety of Virunex-3 in the Treatment of Patients Infected with the Novacov-24 Virus</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/01/09<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>14th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-01-14', '2026-01-14', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-14 10:00:10', '2025-01-14 10:28:15'),
(66, 121, 'ECCT/3/2024-ECCT/24/11/02', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/3/2024-ECCT/24/11/02&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 14 Jan 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Linus Sexton Ori Hill Jacob Mckay,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/24/11/02,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Aliquam fugiat qui officia veniam excepturi et nisi neque enim aliquip tempora,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/24/11/02 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Iusto obcaecati Nam dicta veli</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1042\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47.png</a> dated dated: 1st November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1043\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_2.png</a> dated dated: 2nd November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1044\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_3.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1045\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_4.png</a> dated dated: 3rd November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1046\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_5.png</a> dated dated: 4th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1047\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_6.png</a> dated dated: 5th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1048\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_7.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1049\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_8.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1050\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_9.png</a> dated dated: 9th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1051\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_10.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1052\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_11.png</a> dated dated: 9th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1053\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_12.png</a> dated dated: 20th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1054\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_13.png</a> dated dated: 14th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1055\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_14.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 3<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1056\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_15.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1057\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_16.png</a> dated dated: 7th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1058\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_17.png</a> dated dated: 13th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1059\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_18.png</a> dated dated: 6th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1060\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_19.png</a> dated dated: 14th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1061\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_20.png</a> dated dated: 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1062\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_21.png</a> dated dated: 5th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1063\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_22.png</a> dated dated: 5th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1064\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_23.png</a> dated dated: 12th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1065\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_24.png</a> dated dated: 6th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1066\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_25.png</a> dated dated: 4th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1067\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_26.png</a> dated dated: 12th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1068\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_27.png</a> dated dated: 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1069\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_28.png</a> dated dated: 11th November 2024 Version 4<br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"/attachments/download/1070\">screenshot_from_2024_11_20_08_51_47_29.png</a> dated dated: 11th November 2024 Version 4</span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1.1 Introduction Ipsum at in duis et Primary pharmacodynamics comments Velit dolores deseru Secondary pharmacodynamics comments Tempore dolor et ve Pharmacodynamic drug interactions comments Dolores est obcaeca Pharmacokinetics comments Porro deserunt natus Absorption, Distribution, Metabolism &amp; Excretion comments Ipsam placeat magna Other pharmacokinetic studies comments Maxime fuga Eum ali Animal species selection/Study design comments Et architecto nostru Single dose toxicity comments Recusandae Elit vo Repeat-dose toxicity comments Optio voluptatem E Genotoxicity comments Aut excepteur commod Carcinogenicity comments Est vero reprehende Reproductive and developmental toxicity - comments Nisi asperiores duis Juvenile toxicity studies comments Nostrum sed ipsum ut Other studies (including enhanced PPND studies) comments Veniam nostrud debi Local tolerance comments Saepe debitis ipsam Other toxicity studies comments A natus sunt id ven Additional Considerations comments Dolorum molestiae vo GLP aspects comments Autem at velit labo Overall comment/ conclusion on the non-clinical assessment Ea velit sed quaerat </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Clinical trials are research studies conducted with human participants to evaluate the safety, effectiveness, and potential side effects of medical interventions, such as new drugs, devices, or therapies. These trials are essential for advancing medical knowledge and ensuring treatments meet rigorous standards. By following a structured approach, clinical trials provide a systematic way to assess new interventions before they are widely adopted in healthcare.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	The process of clinical trials typically progresses through multiple phases. Early phases focus on determining safety and optimal dosing in smaller groups, while later phases assess the efficacy and broader application of the intervention in larger populations. This phased approach ensures that each stage addresses specific scientific and medical questions, gradually building a comprehensive understanding of the intervention&#39;s impact.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Ethical guidelines and scientific rigor are crucial in clinical trials to protect participants and maintain public trust. Researchers adhere to principles like informed consent and beneficence while ensuring trials are inclusive and unbiased. By bridging the gap between laboratory research and real-world medical practice, clinical trials play a critical role in improving healthcare outcomes globally.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/24/11/02<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>29th November 2025</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-01-14', '2026-01-14', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-14 12:49:18', '2025-01-14 12:49:38');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(67, 140, 'ECCT/25/01/10/2025(39)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/10/2025(39)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 15th January 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/01/10,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Do tempor eum qui sit aute dolor,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/01/10 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>test</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Cillum nihil eaque asperiores </u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1344\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1348\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_14_27_09.png</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1354\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1359\">expected_appointments_14_jan_2025_1_3.xlsx</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1352\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_3.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1347\">expected_appointments_14_jan_2025_1.xlsx</a> dated: 13th January 2025<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1368\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_14_08_59_01_1_4.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1353\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_14_08_59_01_1_3.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1369\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_7.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1345\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_14_08_59_01_1.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1366\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_6.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1367\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_8.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1370\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_8.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1358\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_4.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1363\">applications_20250114_1429.csv</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1364\">applications_20250114_1426.csv</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1349\">expected_appointments_14_jan_2025_1_2.xlsx</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1365\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_7.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1362\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_5.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1355\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_2.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1361\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_6.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1350\">art_monthly_report_2025_01_14_08_59_01_1_2.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1360\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_5.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1356\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_4.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1357\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_01_14_10_55_20_3.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1351\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_14_16_35_2.png</a> dated: 14th January 2025 Version 2<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1346\">tx_rtt_mer_indicators_report_2025_01_14_09_08_44_2.xls</a> dated: 14th January 2025<br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1343\">screenshot_from_2025_01_14_14_16_35.png</a> dated: 14th January 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	test</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/01/10<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>15th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-01-08', '2026-01-14', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-01-15 10:37:33', '2025-01-24 15:09:07'),
(68, 140, 'ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/10', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/2/2025-ECCT/25/01/10&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n