25 <br>3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1207\">logo_is_b_22.jpg</a> dated  dated: 5th January 2025 <br>4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1208\">logo_is_b_23.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1209\">logo_is_b_24.jpg</a> dated  dated: 1st January 2025 <br>6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1219\">logo_is_b_34.jpg</a> dated  dated: 1st January 2025 <br>7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1218\">logo_is_b_33.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>8. Stability data of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1217\">logo_is_b_32.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1216\">logo_is_b_31.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1215\">logo_is_b_30.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1220\">logo_is_b_35.jpg</a> dated  dated: 6th January 2025 <br>12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1221\">logo_is_b_36.jpg</a> dated  dated: 5th January 2025 <br>13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br><a href=\"/attachments/download/1222\">logo_is_b_37.jpg</a> dated  dated: 5th January 2025 <br>14. Evidence of recent G