/strong><br>Dignissimos rerum no<br><br><strong>Safety comments</strong><br>Animi nihil perspic<br><br><strong>Blinding and unblinding workspace</strong><br>Rerum nesciunt iust<br><br><strong>Blinding and unblinding comments</strong><br>Alias quia voluptas <br><br><strong>Contraception measures workspace</strong><br>Officia sit adipisic<br><br><strong>Contraception measures comments</strong><br>Vel dolore velit nat<br><br><strong>Discontinuation criteria workspace</strong><br>Rem qui a perspiciat<br><br><strong>Discontinuation criteria comments</strong><br>Perferendis minim eo<br><br><strong>Other concomitant workspace</strong><br>Voluptatem et ducimu<br><br><strong>Other concomitant comments</strong><br>Molestiae in elit e<br><br><strong>Safety and Monitoring workspace</strong><br>Amet illo magna rep<br><br><strong>Safety and Monitoring comments</strong><br>Nemo alias repudiand<br><br><strong>Reference Safety Information workspace</strong><br>Quos sed possimus e<br><br><strong>Reference Safety Information comments</strong><br>Aperiam rerum rerum <br><br><strong>Data Safety Monitoring Committee workspace</strong><br>Suscipit quia in cil<br><br><strong>Data Safety Monitoring Committee comments</strong><br>Explicabo Quia inci<br><br><strong>Definition of the end of the trial workspace</strong><br>Deserunt et debitis <br><br><strong>Definition of the end of the trial comments</strong><br>Nostrud velit veniam<br><br><strong>Biological samples used in the study workspace</strong><br>Ipsa temporibus ali<br><br><strong>Biological samples used in the study comments</strong><br>Explicabo Eligendi <br><br><strong>Data protection workspace</strong><br>Error culpa et porr<br><br><strong>Data protection comments</strong><br>Ut atque repudiandae<br><br><strong>Recruitment and informed consent procedures workspace</strong><br>Quis minim architect<br><br><strong>Recruitment and informed consent procedures comment</strong><br>Soluta ut voluptas r<br><br><strong>Benefit/risk assessment workspace</strong><br>Et tempore qui quia<br><br><strong>Comments on the benefit/risk:</strong><br>Dolor fugiat deleni<br><br><strong>Assessorâ€™s overall conclusions workspace</strong><br>Tempora repudiandae <br><br><strong>Overall comment/ conclusion on the clinical assessment:</strong><br>Nihil id facere dol<br><br><strong>1.5.1 REQUESTS FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION</strong><br>Qui laboriosam dolo<br><br><strong>Study plan and design workspace</strong><br>Ea cillum ea ducimus<br><br><strong>Study plan and design comments</strong><br>Culpa obcaecati nisi<br><br><strong>Randomization and blinding workspace</strong><br>Dicta magnam tempori<br><br><strong>Randomization and blinding comments</strong><br>Nulla consequatur T<br><br><strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used workspace</strong><br>Sit voluptas optio <br><br><strong>Sample size, trial power and level of significance used comments</strong><br>In eu sint error aut<br><br><strong>Planned analysis workspace</strong><br>Excepturi voluptates<br><br><strong>Planned analysis comments</strong><br>Mollit ullam et unde<br><br><strong>Interim analysis workspace</strong><br>Voluptas iusto cupid<br><br><strong>Interim analysis comments</strong><br>Tempor aute consequu<br><br><strong>Assessorâ€™s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part workspace</strong><br>Sapiente vel maxime <br><br><strong>Assessorâ€™s Overall Conclusion on the Statistical Part comments</strong><br>Possimus itaque duc<br><br></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Jan 7th</p>\r\n ECCT/25/01/02<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>7th January 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-02-18', '2026-02-18', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-02-18 15:45:25', '2025-02-18 15:45:25');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(79, 196, 'ECCT/25/02/06/2025(50)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/02/06/2025(50)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 19th February 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/02/06,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Sit cupiditate similique iure aut,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/02/06 : Initial Approval;&nbsp; &nbsp;sample</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Test Input</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Voluptatem Doloremque in amet</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1737\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 Version 1<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1738\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1744\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_17_11_53_20_6.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1745\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_4.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1746\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_23.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1747\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_5.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1748\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_6.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1749\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_24.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1750\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_25.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1751\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_7.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 Version 2<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1752\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_8.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1764\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_13.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1763\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_32.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1762\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_12.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1761\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_31.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1760\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_11.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI http://45.79.161.190:8080/admin/attachments/download/1736<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1759\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_30.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements. http://45.79.161.190:8080/admin/attachments/download/1732<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1758\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_29.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1757\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_28.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1756\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_27.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1755\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_10.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1754\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_26.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1753\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_9.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1743\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_3.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1742\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_2.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1741\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_22.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1740\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27_3.xls</a><br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1739\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27_2.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: </span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Test Input</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	ECCT/25/02/06<strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>19th February 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '', 'manager', '2025-02-19', '2026-02-19', 'approved', 0, NULL, '2025-02-19 09:20:41', '2025-02-28 14:27:35');
INSERT INTO `annual_letters` (`id`, `application_id`, `approval_no`, `type`, `content`, `qrcode`, `approver`, `approval_date`, `expiry_date`, `status`, `deleted`, `deleted_date`, `created`, `modified`) VALUES
(80, 196, 'ECCT/25/02/06/2025(51)', 0, '<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><img height=\"86\" src=\"https://lh7-us.googleusercontent.com/eOWVvo3AHW74GguHveDaqdgy3YwNZqOqOO0QtscRoV4hJfcvt8Q6v4oLN3beVNvClvoD1ncu1RhB5D4iuAY-5R9h1aD2lEGqUorBVcQ0azfxsdvIz-WhbF3rA9-VQomtusnP2bNZTuYLFTC6vQ46nQ\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Bookman Old Style&quot;, serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-left: 0px; margin-top: 0px;\" width=\"116\" /></span></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>MINISTRY</strong> <strong>OF</strong> <strong>HEALTH</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>PHARMACY</strong> <strong>AND</strong> <strong>POISONS</strong> <strong>BOARD</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border:0px\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%; border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"left-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Telegram: &quot;MINHEALTH&quot;, Nairobi</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Cell phone: 0709 770 100</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Email: info@pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Website: web.pharmacyboardkenya.org</span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				&nbsp;</td>\r\n			<td style=\"width: 33.33%;border:0px\">\r\n				<div id=\"right-editor\">\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Pharmacy and Poisons Board House</span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Along Lenana Road </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">P.O. Box 27663-00506 </span></span></p>\r\n					<p>\r\n						<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">NAIROBI </span></span></p>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></address>\r\n<address>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">When replying please quote</span></span></address>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Ref.</strong> <strong>No.</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/02/06/2025(51)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 21st February 2025</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Principal</strong> <strong>Investigator</strong> <strong>ECCT/25/02/06,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong>Sit cupiditate similique iure aut,</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Dear Sir/Madam,</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>Re: ECCT/25/02/06 : Initial Approval; </u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>Test Input</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong><u>&nbsp; Voluptatem Doloremque in amet</u></strong><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;bookman old style&quot;, serif;\"><u>.</u></strong></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">Reference is made to the above study.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">We acknowledge receipt of the following documents;</span></span></p>\r\n<div style=\"margin-left: 15px;\">\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">1. Cover Letter (Should list all the submitted documents, their version numbers and dates)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1737\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 Version 1<br />\r\n	2. The Study Protocol<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1738\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	3. Registration of the study at Pan African Clinical Trials Registry https://pactr.samrc.ac.za<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1744\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_17_11_53_20_6.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	4. Patient Information leaflet and Informed consent form<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1745\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_4.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	5. Investigators Brochure/Package inserts<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1746\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_23.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	6. Investigational Medicinal Product Dossier (IMPD)<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1747\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_5.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	7. Adequate data and information from previous studies and Phases to support carrying out of the current study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1748\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_6.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	8. Stability data of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1749\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_24.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	9. GMP certificate of the investigational product from the site of manufacture<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1750\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_25.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	10. Certificate of Analysis of the investigational product<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1751\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_7.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 Version 2<br />\r\n	11. Pictorial Sample of the investigational products. This sample should include the text of the labeling to be used<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1752\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_8.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	12. Signed investigator(s) CV(s) including that of study Pharmacist (NB: The CV should include the current workload of the Principal Investigator )<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1764\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_13.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	13. Evidence of contractual agreement between sponsor and Principal Investigator.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1763\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_32.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	14. Evidence of recent GCP training of the core study staff<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1762\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_12.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	15. DSMB Charter including the composition and meeting schedule<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1761\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_31.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	16. Detailed budget of the study<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1760\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_11.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	17. Financial declaration by Sponsor and/or PI http://45.79.161.190:8080/admin/attachments/download/1736<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1759\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_30.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	18. Signed Declaration by Sponsor or Principal investigator that the study will be carried out according to the protocol and applicable laws, regulations and GCP requirements. http://45.79.161.190:8080/admin/attachments/download/1732<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1758\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_29.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	19. Indemnity cover for PI, investigators and study Pharmacist.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1757\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_28.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	20. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1756\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_27.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1755\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_10.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1754\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_26.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1753\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_9.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sites&rsquo; capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1743\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_3.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1742\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_2.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	26. Payment of fees<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1741\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_22.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025<br />\r\n	27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1740\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27_3.xls</a><br />\r\n	28. Signed Checklist<br />\r\n	<a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1739\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27_2.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 </span></span></div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">After review of the documents, the Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials notes the following:</span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>Trial category workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Amet illum labore<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Trial category comments</strong><br />\r\n	Ab nisi omnis qui ea<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Trial phase workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Consequatur repudian<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Trial phase comments (if in disagreement with the study phase proposed): </strong><br />\r\n	Est in sed veritatis<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Therapeutic condition workspace</strong><br />\r\n	Aut aperiam suscipit<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Brief description of the disease</strong><br />\r\n	Reprehenderit delect<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Brief discussion of clinical pharmacokinetic data, efficacy and safety data described in the IB from previous trials /previously investigated indications(s) for the IMP(s). Non-clinical studies may also be discussed for early or FIH clinical trials. Consideration should be given to the justification provided based on the non-clinical data, for the proposed starting dose, dose steps, and maximum exposure</strong><br />\r\n	Est temporibus corr<br />\r\n	<br />\r\n	<strong>Assessor&rsquo;s discussion on the clinical development:</strong><br /