0. Clinical Trials Insurance cover for study participants<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1756\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_27.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>21. Copy of favorable opinion letter from the local Ethics Review Committee (ERC).<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1755\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_10.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>22. Copy of current Practice Licenses for the Investigators and study Pharmacist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1754\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_26.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>23. Copy of approval letter(s) from collaborating institutions or other regulatory authorities, if applicable<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1753\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_9.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>24. For multicentre/multi-site studies, a site specific addendum for each of the proposed sites including among other things the sitesâ€™ capacity to carry out the study i.e personnel, equipment, laboratory etc<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1743\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_3.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>25. A signed statement by the applicant indicating that all information contained in, or referenced by, the application is complete and accurate and is not false or misleading.<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1742\">art_monthly_report_2025_02_18_07_55_57_2.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>26. Payment of fees<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1741\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_17_12_10_38_22.xls</a> dated: 19th February 2025 <br>27. Statistical Analysis Plan<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/attachments/download/1740\">line_list_of_all_client_2025_02_18_07_49_27_3.xls</a> <br>28. Signed Checklist<br><a href=\"http://45.79.161.190:8080/atta