Eum mag<br><br><strong>Comparator IMP(s) comments</strong><br>Delectus debitis et<br><br><strong>Placebo workspace</strong><br>Repudiandae rem est<br><br><strong>Placebo comments</strong><br>Est laboriosam beat<br><br><strong>Auxilliary medicinal product(s) workspace</strong><br>Repudiandae nesciunt<br><br><strong>Auxilliary medicinal product(s) comments</strong><br>Vitae ea veniam nos<br><br><strong>Additional considerations workspace</strong><br>Aut sed officia ut d<br><br><strong>Additional considerations comments</strong><br>Elit distinctio Qu<br><br><strong>Brief description of the important safety risks associated with trial treatments identified in any previous clinical trials, and as outlined in the IB or SmPC, or from another source</strong><br>Et distinctio Omnis<br><br><strong>Safety comments</strong><br>In omnis porro offic<br><br><strong>Blinding and unblinding workspace</strong><br>Eius corporis aliqua<br><br><strong>Blinding and unblinding comments</strong><br>Anim assumenda elit<br><br><strong>Contraception measures workspace</strong><br>Accusantium omnis en<br><br><strong>Contraception measures comments</strong><br>Sint Nam et enim qu<br><br><strong>Discontinuation criteria workspace</strong><br>Corrupti dolorem in<br><br><strong>Discontinuation criteria comments</strong><br>Laborum est iste cil<br><br><strong>Other concomitant workspace</strong><br>Vitae nostrud perfer<br><br><strong>Other concomitant comments</strong><br>Distinctio Facere i<br><br><strong>Safety and Monitoring workspace</strong><br>Sed veritatis autem <br><br><strong>Safety and Monitoring comments</strong><br>Sint dolor itaque v<br><br><strong>Reference Safety Information workspace</strong><br>Magnam aute a et imp<br><br><strong>Reference Safety Information comments</strong><br>Quibusdam et modi no<br><br><strong>Data Safety Monitoring Committee workspace</strong><br>Minim adipisicing an<br><br><strong>Data Safety Monitoring Committee comments</strong><br>Nulla culpa cum ex o<br><br><strong>Definition of the end of the trial workspace</strong><br>Cum est voluptatem e<br><br><strong>Definition of the end of the trial comments</strong><br>Consectetur accusan<br><br><strong>Biological samples used in the study workspace</strong><br>Sequi id itaque qui<br><br><strong>Biological samples used in the study comments</strong><br>Provident dolor et <br><br><strong>Data protection workspace</strong><br>Eaque expedita eos <br><br><strong>Data protection comments</strong><br>Voluptatem rerum bla<br><br><strong>Recruitment and informed consent procedures workspace</strong><br>Vero consequatur Oc<br><br><strong>Recruitment and informed consent procedures comment</strong><br>Obcaecati nisi neces<br><br><strong>Benefit/risk assessment workspace</strong><br>Recusandae Quidem s<br><br><strong>Comments on the benefit/risk:</strong><br>Sunt dolorem repreh<br><br><strong>Assessorâ€™s overall conclusions workspace</strong><br>Ad laboris optio vo<br><br><strong>Overall comment/ conclusion on the clinical assessment:</strong><br>Dolor quia fugiat ev<br><br><strong>1.5.1 REQUESTS FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION</strong><br>Voluptatem ut molest<br><br></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">The Pharmacy and Poisons Board Expert Committee on Clinical Trials grants approval to the study: <p>\r\n	Test Input</p>\r\n ECCT/25/02/06<strong>.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">This approval is&nbsp;<strong>valid</strong>&nbsp;<strong>for</strong>&nbsp;<strong>one</strong>&nbsp;<strong>year</strong>&nbsp;and in case the study extends beyond one year from the date of this letter, you are required to seek approval before proceeding with the study. The expiry date is <b>28th March 2026</b></span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You should ensure compliance with Kenya Legal, regulatory and GCP requirements</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">All safety reports should be submitted to ECCT as per the current PPB clinical trials guidelines</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">It is your responsibility to inform the PPB of any changes to the protocol, research design and procedures that could introduce new or more than minimum risk to human subjects</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">You are also reminded that upon conclusion of the study, you shall be required to submit the executive summary report of the study within 30 days while a copy of the clinical study report in ICH E3 format should be submitted to us within 180 days of the study closure.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div>\r\n	<p>\r\n		<span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Yours Sincerely,</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:signature</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\">:approver</span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:bookman old style,serif;\"><strong><u>For Chief Executive Officer</u></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', NULL, 'manager', '2025-03-28', '2026-03-28', 'submitted', 0, NULL, '2025-03-28 11:42:44', '2025-03-28 11:42:44');
