(2736, 15, 'comment', NULL, 'Monitor(s) and monitoring reports comments and remarks', NULL, '1. Monitoring of the site was conducted but under dosing not picked out. Risk based monitoring approach now being implemented\r\n2.Some information on the monitoring reports not filled i i.e. monitored by and reviewed by\r\n3. CAPAs were not raised concerning the findings therefore no documented summary that the deficiencies have been addressed \r\n', '', '2020-01-29 09:34:33', '2024-02-14 09:07:16'),
